sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Op as Operator
    participant S as Source workspace
    participant VA as Staging A (source)
    participant VB as Staging B (target)
    participant T as Target workspace
    Note over S: Job A — Airgap Inventory+Export
    Op->>S: run 01 Inventory + 02 Export (source warehouse)
    S->>VA: write run_<id>/ (manifest + checksums)
    Note over Op: THE HANDOFF
    Op->>VB: copy the whole run_<id>/ dir A → B
    Note over T: Job B — Airgap Import
    Op->>T: run 03 Import (run_id = source bundle id)
    T->>VB: read + verify manifest/checksums
    T->>T: create + govern in dependency order (fail-closed)
    T-->>Op: import.xlsx + Outstanding sheet + uc_sync_state
